  "body": "HIGHLY SOUGHT - AFTER ESTABLISHED STREET!\r\n\r\nIntroducing a stunning, sun-drenched, north-facing elevated 857 square meter (more or less) section with a great outlook. \r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to create your forever dream home, build and sell, or acquire and hold, then this could be the opportunity you have been waiting for.\r\n\r\nHere you will enjoy spectacular sunrises, the sparkling blue waters of the Gulf, and unforgettable moonrises across Okoromai Bay.\r\n\r\nLiving in this sought-after area, means you'll have access to Whangaparaoa Golf course, fishing, beaches, boat ramps, Shakespear Regional Park, local walkways, cafes, and restaurants. Gulf Harbour Primary, Wentworth College & Primary is within walking distance. For those who commute to the city, the Gulf Harbour Ferry provides daily crossings to Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nInformation available on request.",
